-- issue #1063: a decl attribute above an `export`ed declaration silently drops the
-- export. dep.mdk says `export greet : String`, but because a `@deprecated` line sits
-- above it the name is not exported. The ONLY diagnostic points HERE, at the importer's
-- import list -- never at the attribute in dep.mdk that actually caused it, and dep.mdk
-- itself is reported completely clean.
import dep.{greet}

main = println greet
